---Upload an image to CF Images. Images up to 10 Megabytes can be uploaded using a single HTTP POST (multipart/form-data) request by sending an image file or passing a URL accessible to the API.
---
---`POST /accounts/{account_id}/images/v1`
---Errors: ImagesAccessNotEnabled.
---@param input cloudflare.images.CreateV1Request
---@return cloudflare.images.CreateV1Response? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_v1(input) end

---Create a CF Images variant that allows you to resize images for different use cases.
---
---`POST /accounts/{account_id}/images/v1/variants`
---Errors: ImagesAccessNotEnabled, VariantNameNotAllowed, VariantAlreadyExists.
---@param input cloudflare.images.CreateV1VariantRequest
---@return cloudflare.images.CreateV1VariantResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_v1_variant(input) end

---Direct uploads allow users to upload images without API keys. A common use case are web apps, client-side applications, or mobile devices where users upload content directly to Cloudflare Images. This method creates a draft record for a future image. It returns an upload URL and an image identifier. To verify if the image itself has been uploaded, send an image details request (accounts/:account_identifier/images/v1/:identifier), and check that the `draft: true` property is not present.
---
---`POST /accounts/{account_id}/images/v2/direct_upload`
---Errors: ImagesAccessNotEnabled, ImageAlreadyExists, InvalidUploadFormat.
---@param input cloudflare.images.CreateV2DirectUploadRequest
---@return cloudflare.images.CreateV2DirectUploadResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:create_v2_direct_upload(input) end

---Delete an image on Cloudflare Images. On success, all copies of the image are deleted and purged from cache.
---
---`DELETE /accounts/{account_id}/images/v1/{image_id}`
---Errors: ImagesAccessNotEnabled, ImageNotFound.
---@param input cloudflare.images.DeleteV1Request
---@return any? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:delete_v1(input) end

